+
+## Agent form tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up pages expose `sign-in` and `sign-up` tools through the
+[WebMCP Declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api).
+Each tool accepts the form's required `username` and `password` fields and uses
+the same submission handler as the visible form. Success and failure messages
+are returned to the agent through the native submit event's `respondWith()`;
+credentials and authentication tokens are not included in tool results.
+
+Use a browser with WebMCP support enabled to discover these tools on their
+respective pages. Submissions require the user's review (`toolautosubmit` is
+omitted). Browsers without WebMCP ignore the tool attributes and retain the
+normal form behavior.
